commit 67ffb0f8687e28cb7d2afd24bc92ae5afd38da2e
Author: poupou97 <nbp85hn@gmail.com>
Date:   Thu Jul 30 14:17:02 2026 +0700

    fix(WTM-145): P0 §2 — single-locale localization, ban bilingual labels (#68)
    
    - Extend AppStrings (~37 new keys VI/EN): titles, More entries, KPI/section
      labels, AI action + result-card labels, journeyRealized*, opportunityCreateGoal
    - Sweep every bilingual ' · ' label across 8 UI screens to context.l10n.<key>
      (Home, More, Reports, Finance, Timeline, Goal detail, Opportunity detail)
    - Wire orphan keys (actionCancel/actionSearch/actionViewAll/titleGoalDetail),
      drop dead keys (actionAll/actionSave/actionRetry)
    - P0 localization suite (test/features/tongtai/p0/localization_test.dart):
      bilingual-literal scan (regression: fails on old code), unused-key check,
      vi≠en spot check, runtime locale switch + persistence over languageProvider
    - Update label assertions in finance/reports/timeline/app_strings tests to
      single-locale strings
    
    Evidence: flutter analyze clean · 975/975 tests pass
    
    Co-authored-by: Claude Fable 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

